{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1456,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9819d3db7514681e3f1077d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有一套是大鸣大放同学教我的\n热身动作。我能……\n稍微试试看吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb988ca36ce5bfb909a140d4aa71a16673a2171f83c7d978c1ac2a4130b9031",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:303c5b04fdf0a27f72aef84e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你心胸宽广又温暖……训练员就像\n夏日的大海一样，所以我才能把\n自己想说的话说出来吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d92dc338171ed9864a39d81c240f81c7e2b481585723e38c0c017488297765c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a235d00d9b5c5754881bdae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上泳装真的会变得更开放……也许\n是真的。我想和训练员一起\n努力尝试各种事情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "79e34eb6ffb14dc7b9e3b8092fbae6f804f26de1741796b0328de203af1e9705",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8962d2ce86e61211e84256d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有时候也会徒劳无功……\n但比起以前一直不敢鼓起勇气的自己，\n现在的我更让我感到自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d64136ff7a3369b175f9c9460e50631712cb26713c1e4e5ffd9a9930d15863b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:825e30d5eb610dc6e4eb2684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你…\r\n属于我的『伟大训练员』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d8ea3076459be5bd65c005c761f94699e54b5232a9c0c17d46e4a7efc1dde08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f1b07cb2f234142f56afab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的优点…\r\n你教会了我很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a0d6218655b4f19b7eafdc38fc716497605f1891d7544b0d60ec65ae9356c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a555393de5d313758b5d1db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下个赛季……还有更远的未来，\n也想和训练员先生一起走下去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9daaaa5e609917c06e077684921a815b45ffed3bb3d910cfcd34e203e250d79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17260af4e345f8ddf89cfd46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺着波浪……我们才能走到这里啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5dbdb7c171da6fe6c0e293ceef6e04547db51515b0daf935274d9e07b7668e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb8aac3419e6c25427bb8146",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积累是很重要的，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "411f6fcd69125e3993ebd128784b8458ba2c609f0f6e43a3a4154a94806f2b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14607b636f2c563485b7d4b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也有这样的力量…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "193df5a630e991dac2fc71b82e5d131fb5e1d7a98cef03ade2d0f9da0967f0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c0255b00bbc8da6327b362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是高尚俊逸。\r\n那个…请多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea3c4b94d165b8ffd070541b9780583cc7ab73ebfb43727994329845a7ec1343",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee783b376315cf3e3325e4b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能再蜷缩了…\r\n我也是，伟大的赛马娘…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f9ea4dd01da5da579a199c77fb242831aa518edc7695f785f5b2cabe0d3a10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a15f54859f75b37e96af92aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "役に立てるようにならなきゃ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce435417fb3269383b2e8c4b9d7e6ca96ca1dc2a2790a6b4d54a0b5d106eed1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bf24f42f49490b4643664bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "て、手伝えることがあるなら…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58405ff293ec72926c751c943c94014811f68e38334ebd9e70a0b3f422155f35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:344aac413f99dc9b8cd4bfc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我要蜕变了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "194182919964e43fd29548f82f9ef6acc5c8d6de9865da777e957e9c31f481fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d599e40710e94c7cc2da60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "泳装的威力……好像真的很厉害……",
      "source_fingerprint": "958d07fb9735243c4f21d5227a4cc62e927429d02910958897df1e375a7594a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79ab3ebfe412b701c3fc54aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍、稍微大胆一点……\n不不不，果然还是做不到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e03ee96219385b5150a975d632e4b90d08f9db56b2ab11e4d4d5133df281d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b7e3d55054822f922b864f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高尚、骏逸……\n不、不奇怪吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d734bc5d7db5195f729ebb44a932e218c5d3901a10175821a140962fb5948acb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da536900384a0317f067ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいわ、見てあげる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4628dbb1204aa16dfb2e5ee68ccd155d6c8565f5bed78c40505109454d7847be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d1e2b0e49566dfaaac82f2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "示してみせるわ…、\r\n私の、女王としての矜持を。\r\nでなきゃ…っ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2228a4779da1e593470eba20052b93ed891c135016a5242d1fcf82efea3d04e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea13af9873cec15af207e9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高尚也觉得自己受到大家应援的支撑，\r\n所以才想回应吧。\r\n这是很重要的事，非常重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6acd56dd0abe32fa3c16da052353e3088ebc867275f311932eb0f1e08871fe18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ecfe4d3c3a06c01c498a6d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟上来吧，强击！\r\n今后，我也会继续让你看到\r\n强大的背影……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17208f8ec1d1b8c515e19b0059e7361953c5c4a489ffd777b3554f994c45ca6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109c760cc41051a19ca8e4f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こちらはイベントミッションよ！\r\n頂点たるにふさわしい\r\n成果をあげていきましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f39c0aafe9eb90587e674d96820c27564e7028ec9fbb895e1e316e052426582f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f9260b70760a19b40c5fce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベント、お疲れさまです。\r\n報酬は行いへの正当な評価です。\r\nしっかり受け取ってくださいね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01cf2e1b6dfcd0250310cd4a32e744b6bedad9f6f8642f8164147ab538eb469a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d5c22b7621d5665d44546cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目指すは『頂点』、おわかりですよね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce90fbc779f449646a5f234ac848c26cd35972553cea5dde84fd69951f0d5fb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e122bfbb6d516e8ff3dbd22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さ、次はなにを手伝えば？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cda4c97281a21a6a508da5b021653be88b99084603965529d6a96576a41c023",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd31ff63910099d58bfe3e73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうぞ頼ってくださいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa1350d2d65cb9a4d6de678f06ccc459d58c8d9e0d1e448a4132fb3b2bd63c45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e57bf65ac87889df64e9613",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:964f35d623f0f038698813fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起的话即使是海的对面\r\n也能到达♪　无论世界何处\r\n都要带我前往哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "8997d85fc527ebe408abbd389a4587a417f01cd0d5292b599c149606c2f61777",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8a7c7015b7307294cbfa8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "698c2cc1ffd336d58630c670458028fcab40df52e6c4a1bdcc6de96366165a71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67578e65af5f2cc5c2090c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "464c5fdc2e39f69c3f953f52447eb178a98976c447d3dd5387c573ca3f5b5e2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62a64e62390f8baf38fefa28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有件衣服想去看看——\r\n但是妈妈又好像还有工作——\r\n……欸嘿，你能陪我去一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8091cc3ca58f5d84f341357aa508a7792d667dcdc7ea2a43da1cb5c33ab4324a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfe1e0c4c437eaee22265310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲的包修复的很漂亮呢！\r\n带着这条新换的带子\r\n一起再刻下新的回忆吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b23d2762788ea60363e834e020f30bc405438baab0fa0f9b338bf93c3b969f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c988d038f8413042d58bb66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n今年也和家人一起去了料亭。\r\n享受到了高雅的气氛~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a911644619e15aed7ea35f1afaaea500f60862362adb04607e6f5f2dfaff0f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a25c18e2ea74ce1c54ae64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经和姐姐交换了巧克力♪\r\n骏逸亲还在搜寻中！\r\n看到她的话记得告诉我哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "644d32d7f503c821d11562e3176edbfe9215a7a60bb0c6635f0727a7ec7238fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9d61f39c36b416a058f1918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请给我巧克力~~~~♡\r\n欸嘿，果然有呢♪\r\n我就知道训练员亲会为我准备的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f12ac6153f533056e19939d65a96c53b7ecff1161fea2f90bb3390622faa7930",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8983e20cebb5b2d21fc9ab87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迪拜的夜间动物园好像很有趣♪\r\n周围都布满星空什么的\r\n不觉得超浪漫吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "549cb88f9ba1f8bce24e38646844bce4c93cfb9b557992f8a7e07502232edd07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:065cecdcb015aea528f69a48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "trick or treat☆\r\n训练员亲这么温柔，\r\n应该知道该选哪个对吧~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e64efb24dfd0038a8f60fe841b530f82cf9d6c8e8f3ebc79b432fadc1f3f28d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c890c30be56e39dac50c8a9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想去看圣诞节彩灯啊~♪\r\n上流又华丽！\r\n呐，要不我们现在就去吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6af9ef5216624dcd15bf596237d06319f453efae3fe9848b384e15cb7b7146e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36665805b68ee7b0104c023d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲的房间里有圣诞树吗？\r\n需要我帮你装一个吗？\r\n保证能装的闪闪发光哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d39a41c97679a81e21322c4fd4e652878f69582cab202f90e737092a2bc7a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:690ac8e263170b64575e738e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好啦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c1a0a8005e85ea0f7f584b88aac0959555bba2d32d6344ac5428944ba3330e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:736b1198b45e1f090e67d3f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也有了各种各样的回忆呢♪\r\n对了，要出些谜题测试一下\r\n还记得多少吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8efe4f6f89aa26846fec0b0fc5d7bcfb442dee96bbedcddfbe780cbcee00be1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2753f2e5396616777a2ab7ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲生日快乐～！\r\n今天就让我来做你的姐姐吧♪\r\n——『来，说出你的愿望吧！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec92df42aa1db4515d267f4a34c69b7c2e15be297ae61fe257a4d19dbed0f6e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3316c0fb7bbdeecb9b5c832",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去买东西吗？\r\n还是想多和我说说话？\r\n今天把训练员亲想做的都做了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d9710daf5f24b476007f8f18520d56fe5279b6d9e5a44f2af7c759b3966cd15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f38a3f5e4f965cd8222c9d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最~~喜欢过生日了！\r\n毕竟这可是大家让我成为\r\n世界上最快乐的人的日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4f5320880af46de6a1d694011e997a137224fbcfc2a3c0d8e9c6d17397a9be0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91c0dad916c0e8adc4aee4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是训练员亲送的礼物，\r\n不管是什么我都很开心♪\r\n毕竟你都有在为我着想呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "97b64c49ff062654801a46df142f8d5063e6cd70cb2d8057af050422f5f22b53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec327bf9bdb3ff0d6bfb87e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了。\r\n记得查看一下哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "32547dd1cb571daea88f0c7cc13dea00c37224ded6db57b90aaa39cd055e8946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdab5291a1827df72ec402c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了！\r\n呐，我可以打开看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3963fb8682fc41203791a0325ff1f23d9a3082de4260a94bb43662a07f857043",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24fa7c4ee80136d6fd9216ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成！\r\n训练员亲努力了呢♪\r\n真棒真棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7e210901c87f13cec8ca69ce43bdd8635d9f4bb3bff15d05e5cf7c242b72357",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c13a4e62753526e5b8129176",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马上就有活动了！\r\n上流的奖励什么的~……会有吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86fa61ed82ca6c68a95dae812b30f6b2c97d9e936512870569c6a9cf2efef28d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce066f18123c5b2729336b79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是在举办活动呢！\r\n一起去看看吧！\r\n快点快点♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aafd1d7e92a0f5feafed020818a7ddad9376360e3c03728334bdba43ef81d5d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1960c5fea0c511b0951f63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2fc41fc2a37ee08441f40c67d9ba7a9c82aa96fa79524ef44330e764709db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba0d59efe0a269547ae87b56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "图鉴等级上升了！\r\n训练员亲真了不起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa4cabcae27eed97125eb8ec2cbc67bd444f99cc1dbfcc9d6906db4a73728d42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50d5c01c39eeffe72ca94be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝴蝶结、花边、还有爱心，\n全都超级可爱，我都喜欢♡\n训练亲你最喜欢哪一个呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab15145c5fd78d6c17830349757f92a84429660e744a717c11878932864ae2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3687a5f935d3f4aa6d1104f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我经常和姐姐一起去逛街呢。\n姐姐很有品味~\n总是帮我选最适合我的东西♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "057279aeab3ec9df40a62106be05ff4490a3280fa8524d1d361664372f34817a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2ca925022b28eb3b506cd01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也想和高尚亲戴一样的戒指啊，\n如果是简单一点的款式，\n高尚亲会戴吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec20bb1fd4de427da7ec8ffdc1b4491f88c190a750d1f00280a5bf4e04018ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a7bc80aaaa10f165d112fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得好啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f9362166ef0353737981a55017696ac990c7c4cea986a1398f2a22dac7e307",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
